= Anakin's Choice

Anakin Skywalker asks to address the Jedi Council. He tells them everything: his marriage, his nightmares, Palpatine's long and flattering friendship, and the things the Chancellor has begun to say to him about power. Then he asks the Council what it wants him to be.

The Masters are silent for a long time. Then Obi-Wan Kenobi stands beside his old apprentice. Whatever the Order becomes now, Anakin will help to make it, and he has chosen the light to do it.
